        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Wernher von Braun\n- Products: V-2 rocket, Saturn V, communication satellites\n- Organizations: NASA\n- Projects: NASA communication satellite program\n\nFacts:\n- Wernher von Braun was a German engineer credited with inventing the V-2 rocket.\n- Wernher von Braun was also credited with developing the Saturn V rocket.\n- On April 6, 1967, NASA launched a communication satellite as part of a NASA communication satellite program.\n- Wernher von Braun was also a supervisor of the NASA communication satellite program associated with the April 6, 1967 launch.",
